[05:42.48]counterpart [ˈkaʊntəpɑːt]n. 副本；对应的人或物；(交易)对 方；对等基金；相对定单
[05:48.72]emerge [iˈmɜːdʒ]vi. 显露；出现，发生 例 A smile emerged on her face on hearing that she had a promotion. 搭 emerge from 自…出现
[06:00.00]floppy [ˈflɒpi]n. 软盘 a. 松软的；下垂的 例 Sony ceased all floppy disk production due to the lack of demand in 2011. 搭 floppy disk 软盘
[06:12.12]endeavour [ɪnˈdevə(r)]n. 尽力，竭力 v. 竭力(做到)；试图或 力图(做某事) 例 The company endeavours to give the best service you could ever imagine. 搭 do sb.'s endeavours 尽力，竭力 / make every endeavour 尽一切努力 / make sb.'s best endeavours 尽某人最大的努力
[06:34.56]productive [prəˈdʌktɪv]a. 生产的；多产的；富有成效的
